<title>JAPAN: Japan parliament may appoint PM early Nov - official.</title>
<headline>Japan parliament may appoint PM early Nov - official.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A special session of parliament to appoint the prime minister following Japan's general election on Sunday is likely to be held in early November, a senior official of one of the parties in the outgoing coalition government told reporters on Monday.</p>
</text>
